# Spark IDE keymap - proven long-form tokens (open / quit).
# After ask forms. Short o/q already proven - this slice documents
# full-word script aliases open/quit (same cmds, not new tokens).
# Dry: script open -> {"cmd":"open"} + paint; quit ends loop.
# Also proves single ide key open + ide key quit.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_keys_long.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven keys only.

ide keys "examples/fixtures/ide/cmds_long.txt"

ide key open "examples/hello.spark"

ide key quit
